Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.portal
Name: HCG Portal (Beta)
Version: 0.1.0~beta4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Beta test build. HCG Portal adds a luminous, interactive portal to the Cover Sheet of an unlocked iPhone, below the clock and above notifications: a dark translucent centre with slowly turning cyan-and-violet energy rings. It appears only after iOS has unlocked the iPhone (Face ID, Touch ID or passcode) and never on the locked Lock Screen; locking removes it at once. Tap it for a radial menu (Nexus, Backgrounds, Devices, HCG Apps). Adjustable position, size, colour, brightness, speed and intensity, with a live preview. Moves, shrinks or collapses around notifications, media controls, the flashlight and the camera. Off after installation; enable it in Settings. Unlock gating and touch repair development build. Real-device verification pending.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Tag: purpose::extension, role::enduser
